  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "12. Fight Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "12.06",
    "summary": "This fight type is open to a unit that is unengaged, or that was unengaged when the Fight step began and has since become engaged in this phase. The unit may make one extra Pile-in move and then fights following Making Attacks (04). The unit must also be eligible to fight in the Fight Step.",
